- Angular is not the first framework to use signals. Knockout.js, for example, already
    used signals a long time ago. More recently, Solid.js, Vue and Svelte also adopted
    signals as the building blocks of their state management. Signals are getting so
    popular, that the teams of these frameworks are even trying to standardize them
    into the JavaScript language itself!
